    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Record dense somatic bioelectric time series and compare fitted statistical-dynamics models with matched neural networks using predefined attractor, correlation, and transition statistics. The same model class must predict held-out perturbation responses in both systems.";
